<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE rate falls to 20.935 percent.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE rate falls to 20.935 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell by 11.5 basis points to 20.935 percent on Thursday, from 21.05 percent on Wednesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558))</p>
